description	"Duros Zhug Brother Gang Member

A gang of bounty hunters who prefer swarm tactics and street combat over any precision or single combat strategies.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Cheap Blaster Pistol (1)
-- Mag Reload
- Surplus Blaster Carbine (1)
-- DC Carbine, 10% Slower RoF, 10% Less Damage and FP Drain
- Zhug Vibroknife
-- Blue/Cyan Styles
-- 2 Chain Combo
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- Low Damage(40)/Cripples On Hit
- Zhug Choke-Dust Canister (1)
-- Deals 0 Damage, Conc Grenade
-- Blinds, Slows, and Stuns Targets

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- Ammo (2)
- Assemble (3)
- 100% Slower Cooldown On Abilities
- Stamina (1)

^8Abilities:
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[CS4]
-- Pulls/Cripples On Hit
- Dodge (1) ^3[CS2]
- Sprint (1) ^[CS1]"
